Z||000000||FieroRyan||11-23-2001||02:51 AM||||I want to get either one of these wheels:<P>Fittipaldi 500SS 15X6.5 5-100/114 35S<BR>Konig Reign 15X6.5 5-100 40S<P>with either of these tires:<P>Pirelli P6000 Sport Veloce  - P195/60R-15 87H <BR>Kumho Ecsta Supra 712 - 205/55R-15 88V B <P><BR>Which will work with the base Fiero better?  Will I see any difference in Speedometer vs actual speed, etc...?  Help me out, I don't know anything about how any of this works  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Standard||11-23-2001||03:00 AM||||You'll probably want to go with something a little bit wider.... hmmm, nevermind.  just saw the wheels are 6.5" wide.  I'd go with a 205/60, that's the stock size on the front of GT's.  The speedo will be off by a small amount, but not enough to matter.  With the 205/55 it'll read a little bit higher than you're actually going.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
